      "created_at": "2026-09-22T11:48:56Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-22T13:15:12Z",
      "body": "Dear MAP authors,\n\nThank you for publishing this work and for making the code and pretrained weights publicly available.\n\nI'm also trying to evaluate MAP, and I would like to add two questions about the evaluation setup to this issue, which would help in reproducing the reported metrics:\n\n1. Cells per condition: I would appreciate it if you could clarify whether a fixed number of cells was used for each drug condition during evaluation, or all available cells in each condition. I'm also curious whether conditions with fewer than a certain number of cells were excluded from training or evaluation, and if so, what threshold was used.\n\n2. Dose in evaluation (following Q4): If the model is trained with dose conditioning, I was wondering whether the evaluation metrics are also computed separately for each dose. For example, when computing PDS, is a condition defined as a drug, or as a drug \u00d7 dose combination?\n\nThank you very much for your time and help.",
      "author_association": "NONE",
