      "updated_at": "2026-09-12T12:15:32Z",
      "body": "Hi, thank you for sharing this great work and the pretrained MAP model \u2014 we found the framework very inspiring.\n\nWe have successfully reproduced the inference pipeline with epoch_3.pt and obtained the 2000-dimensional pred_hvg output. From the preprocessing code, it seems that the output order corresponds to hvg_info['hvg_gene_ids'] in top2000_hvg_info_seurat_v3_batch_aware.pkl.\n\nWould it be possible to share this file, or simply the ordered list of the 2000 gene IDs/symbols corresponding to pred_hvg dimensions 0\u20131999?\n\nThank you very much!",
