      "created_at": "2026-09-15T10:41:04Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-17T08:27:03Z",
      "body": "Hi, thank you for releasing MAP and the pretrained weights!\n\nWe have successfully run inference with epoch_3.pt on human preadipocyte control cells and obtained the [B, S, 2000] predicted expression output. We would like to interpret these responses using adipogenesis and lipid-metabolism gene sets.\n\nCould you please share the exact ordered hvg_info['hvg_gene_ids'] list corresponding to output dimensions 0\u20131999, ideally from top2000_hvg_info_seurat_v3_batch_aware.pkl? A plain-text or JSON list would also be sufficient. If the IDs are numeric tokens, could you also confirm which gene vocabulary should be used to map them to gene symbols?\n\nIt would also be helpful to confirm the decoder\u2019s expression scale\u2014for example, whether its targets were raw counts or log1p values after normalization to a total of 1,000 within the selected HVGs.\n\nThese details would help us align predicted and control expression correctly for downstream functional analysis. Thank you for your time and support!\n\nThank you!",
